  "limits": [
    "R9 reads only level and account age: fake accounts that wait 30 days and reach level 3 (attacker D) are not stopped, whether they join, post or like",
    "R9 must act on posts, likes and friends as well as joins (r9_scope = all): on joins only, young levelled-up fakes that post push a group into the default list",
    "at launch, when nearly every account is young, burst_w = 0 leaves almost nothing to learn from: switch the burst rule on once enough accounts are older than 30 days, and use the level bar alone until then",
    "group sizes count only the members who count, so a group of mostly young members can look small and share the newcomer slot (newcomer share 0.203 with R9 off, 0.195 chosen)"
